  "title": "World Defense Show 2022",
  "summary": "The World Defense Show 2022, in its first edition, focused on the joint integration between air, land, and sea defense systems, satellites, and information security. The Kingdom organized it to become an integrated and unique exhibition of its kind that provides local and international manufacturers, parties concerned with the military and security industries sector, and all interested visitors a unified platform under one roof. It will be an anticipated addition to the series of international defense exhibitions around the world.",
